### Signal requests for IntelliJ (HTTP Client). Select the "local" environment.
### Keys come from requests/http-client.private.env.json (made by: python scripts/make_http_env.py).

### Health / docs
GET {{host}}/docs

### 1. support_ticket
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/support_ticket/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-ticket-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"ticket":{"id":"ZD-1","created":1784609488000,"description":"My parcel never arrived, call me on +44 7700 900519","requester":{"customer_ref":"C1","locale":"en-GB"},"brand":"ridgeline"}}

### 2. app_store
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/app_store/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{app_store}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"review_id":"rv_1","rating":3,"title":"Kann ich per Rechnung bezahlen?","body":"Kann ich auch per Rechnung bezahlen?","reviewed_at":"2026-07-21T05:53:50Z","territory":"DE","app":"ridgeline"}

### 3. nps_survey
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/nps_survey/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{nps_survey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"response_id":"nps-1","score":10,"comment":"Free returns made me confident to order.","submitted":"21/07/2026 02:52","customer_id":"C1","market":"UK","account":"ridgeline"}

### 4. in_app
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/in_app/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{in_app}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"event":"feedback_submitted","ts":"2026-07-21T03:11:49.000+02:00","user":{"id":"C1","locale":"fr-FR"},"app":"ridgeline","payload":{"screen":"orders/returns","message":"Retour envoyé il y a 4 jours, toujours pas remboursé.","mood":"angry"}}

### 5. social
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"post_id":"1790000000000087109","text":"Parcel marked as delivered but nothing arrived.","created_at":"Tue, 21 Jul 2026 01:52:52 +0000","lang":"en","author_handle":"@jan1134"}

### Read back (wait a few seconds for the worker)
GET {{host}}/v1/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{support_ticket}}

### Expect 401: wrong key
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: wrong
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"hi"}

### Expect 403: key for another channel
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{nps_survey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"hi"}

### Expect 400: broken JSON
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"cut off

### Expect 422: no text
POST {{host}}/v1/sources/social/feedback
X-Api-Key: {{social}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"post_id":"1","text":"   "}
